simTycoonLeague: green.
   Only the champion goes up, the tables add up, the squad decides the title, and a reload replays nothing.
   A new club is promoted before its first Sell up and sooner than the old win count managed.
   Every older save lands in the division it had earned, no club that can compete is walled in, and all ten controls fired.
